          "_name": "article21",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article021\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButton\" title=\"Buttons\">\n        <header>Card</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Color\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12\">\n                    <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">Vision &amp; Philosophy (The \"Republic\" Metaphor)</h5>\n                    <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .main-button\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>Viewing personal evolution, technical endeavors, and creative archives through the lens of a self-sustained state.</b></h6>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-3  main-button\" mbr-if=\"showButton\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                        <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            Learn more\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-lg-8 side-features\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                        <ul>\n                            <li>Just as a republic balances infrastructure, culture, and progress, this space unifies diverse disciplines—from frontier tech and social initiatives to visual storytelling—into an interconnected ecosystem built on autonomy, continuous research, and purpose-driven work.\n</li><li>Rooted in open-source principles, user-first design, sustainability, and continuous learning, the Republic is designed to mature far beyond a simple personal archive. The overarching goal is to cultivate a self-sustaining platform that collaborates with and supports like-minded individuals and communities both locally and globally. Through initiative-driven commerce—such as partnering with local artisans, customizing ethically sourced items, and reinvesting proceeds—this space directly funds forward-thinking projects, social causes, and grassroots livelihoods.\n</li><li>The \"Republic\" represents a deliberate framework: technical builds serve as the infrastructure, media acts as the record, and human-centric insights guide the direction. It is a long-term commitment to building accessible tools, documenting raw perspectives, and empowering others through shared value and creative independence.</li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vvmiao9IbA",
          "_anchor": "article21-bb",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            "& when (@reverseContent)": {
              ".row": {
                "flex-direction": "row-reverse"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#a6a99c"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "background": "@cardbg",
              "padding": "2.25rem 2.25rem 1rem 2.25rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 1.5rem 0.5rem 1.5rem"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1200px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 1.5rem 0.5rem 1.5rem"
              }
            },
            ".main-button": {
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "2rem"
              }
            },
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "padding-left": "2.25rem",
                "list-style": "none",
                "li": {
                  "position": "relative",
                  "list-style": "none",
                  "margin-bottom": "2rem",
                  "&:before": {
                    "position": "absolute",
                    "left": "-1.5em",
                    "content": "\"\"",
                    "display": "flex",
                    "justify-content": "center",
                    "align-items": "center",
                    "color": "@iconColor",
                    "background-color": "@iconColor",
                    "width": "0.5em",
                    "height": "0.5em",
                    "top": "0.4em",
                    "border-radius": "50%"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text UL": {
              "text-align": "justify"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle, .main-button": {
              "color": "#a6a99c",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "text-align": "justify",
              "color": "#edefeb"
            }
          },
          "_name": "article21",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article021\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButton\" title=\"Buttons\">\n        <header>Card</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Color\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12\">\n                    <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">The Sovereign behind the Republic</h5>\n                    <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .main-button\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>A quick snapshot of the creator's background, technical focus, and creative pursuits.</b></h6>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-3  main-button\" mbr-if=\"showButton\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                        <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            Learn more\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-lg-8 side-features\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                        <ul>\n                            <li>A multi-disciplinary builder, visual artist, and digital creator operating from Metro Manila, Philippines.\n</li><li>RJrb constructs and deploys technical solutions using tools like GitHub and Mobirise, backed by hands-on experience in specialized AI and data annotation platforms including SuperAnnotate, V7 Darwin, and Icecow. While technical workflows provide the structural foundation, visual arts and photography remain the core passion—born as quiet pastimes and refined through moments of solitude and self-reliance.\n</li><li>Influenced by archival literature, vintage editorial design, and classic editions of publications like Reader's Digest and Vogue, RJrb absorbs the timeless integration of lifestyle, architecture, technology, and fine arts. This unique convergence shapes a distinct visual language and strategic vision—blending technical precision, aesthetic depth, and social awareness into every project under the Republic.</li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "article21-bc",
          "_cid": "vvmiQ2kIp3",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
