          "_name": "article18",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article18\" group=\"Article\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#9fe870\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#000000\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n          <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n              <b>List</b>\n            </h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n              Press \"Enter\" to add more items to the list.\n            </h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n          <ul>\n            <li><b>Original Content:</b> Unless otherwise noted, all original content published on this site—including custom 3D CAD designs, research articles, visual artwork, original photography, and site branding—is the intellectual property of <b>RJrb</b>. You may view and download content for personal, non-commercial offline use, but you may not republish, sell, or redistribute material without explicit permission.\n</li><li><b>Third-Party Stock Photography:</b> Certain imagery across the site is sourced via the Mobirise Free Online Library from <b>Pixabay </b>and utilized in accordance with the <a href=\"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/\" class=\"text-success\" target=\"_blank\">Pixabay License</a>. Copyright for these assets remains with their respective creators.\n</li><li><b>Trademarks &amp; Icons:</b> All brand names, logos, and icons displayed—including <b>Facebook, Instagram, YouTube, Android, and Apple</b>—are the registered trademarks of their respective owners. Their inclusion is strictly for identification, linking, and navigational purposes and does not imply endorsement, affiliation, or sponsorship.</li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li><li><b>\n</b></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
